{"meta":{"id":"tt29547746","type":"series","name":"El conde de Montecristo","imdb_id":"tt29547746","description":"Edmond Dantès, un marinero acusado injustamente de traición, es encarcelado en el castillo de If, frente a las costas de Marsella. Tras escapar y adoptar la identidad del conde de Montecristo, trama su venganza contra quienes lo acusaron injustamente.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt29547746.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mKZLq5Vy3InX1dFHtSFPxodCiOx.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4n9IXEgFy37JvMpmAG1oVQSFrme.png","genres":["Action & Adventure","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-01-13T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"7.9","country":"France, Italy","cast":["Sam Claflin","Ana Girardot","Blake Ritson","Mikkel Boe Følsgaard","Harry Taurasi","Michele Riondino","Jeremy Irons","Lino Guanciale","Nicolas Maupas","Jason Barnett","Méghane De Croock","Ramona Von Pusch","Poppy Corby-Tuech","Gabriella Pession","Karla-Simone Spence","Amaryllis April August","Martina Laird","Nicholas Farrell","Robin Greer","Luke Carroll","Ben Moor","Simone Zambelli","Louise Gold","Roger Sloman","Nell Baker","Henry Lawfull","Leo Harris"],"writer":["Bille August","Alexandre Dumas"],"trailers":[{"source":"Jk9ncn5rM-8","type":"Trailer","name":"The Count of Monte Cristo (2024) | Official Trailer | M™ Entertainment","ytId":"Jk9ncn5rM-8","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"Jk9ncn5rM-8","title":"The Count of Monte Cristo (2024) | Official Trailer | M™ Entertainment"}],"links":[{"name":"7.9","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt29547746"},{"name":"Action & Adventure","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Action+%26+Adventure"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"Sam Claflin","